---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="About"
	description="Revenue Driven Marketing is a performance marketing agency built on attribution-first, audit-driven Google Ads and Meta Ads management."
>
	<h1>About</h1>

	<p>
		Revenue Driven Marketing manages Google Ads and Meta Ads accounts with one question driving
		every decision: is this spend actually producing revenue, or just activity? Most PPC
		management stops at clicks, conversions, and ROAS as reported by the platform, numbers
		that are easy to inflate and easy to misread. We start from attribution: what's the platform's
		reported conversion actually worth, and does the account structure reflect how customers
		really buy.
	</p>

	<!-- TODO(Kareem): replace with your real years of experience / background once finalized -->
	<p>
		The agency is founder-led by a PPC specialist with hands-on experience running and auditing
		live Google Ads and Meta Ads accounts, not agency theory, actual account work.
	</p>

	<h2>What We Believe</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>Audits come before optimization. You can't fix what you haven't diagnosed.</li>
		<li>Hands-on account management, not a "set it and forget it" retainer.</li>
		<li>Straight answers about what's working, what isn't, and why, including when the honest answer is "spend less here."</li>
	</ul>

	<p class="cta-line">
		<a href="/contact/">Want a Second Opinion on Your Account?</a>
	</p>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	h1 {
		font-size: 2rem;
	}
	ul {
		padding-left: 1.25rem;
	}
	li {
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
	}
	.cta-line a {
		font-weight: 600;
		text-decoration: none;
	}
</style>
